## Animation

What to test:

- Click Randomise, Shuffle and Rapid Updates; sectors re-tween smoothly without flicker.
- Click Add/Remove at Start, Middle and End; new sectors animate in and removed sectors animate out.
- Click Reset; the chart returns to the original six-slice layout.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Animation Example" name="animation" type="generated" /%}

## Donut Animation

What to test:

- Entry animation expands sectors from the centre with inner labels and inner circle in place.
- Callout labels and inner labels remain legible once the animation settles.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Donut Animation Example" name="animation-donut" type="generated" /%}

## Duplicate Labels

What to test:

- Two equal-value slices sharing the label "duplicate" render without overlapping callouts or dropped labels.

{% chartExampleRunner title="Duplicate Labels Example" name="duplicate-labels" type="generated" /%}
